[12:47] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'acoustic editing. You can adjust the speed of any speech without the pitch warping. Normally, if you speed up audio, the person sounds like a chipmunk. &gt;&gt; And so, my fellow Americans, ask not'

